---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import { topics } from '../data/topics';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>The next era will be built by people still willing to be beginners.</h1>
				<p class="subhead">
					I write about AI, quantum computing, energy, and the institutions that hold societies
					together. The future is genuinely uncertain, and there is a whole industry profiting
					from the anxiety of that. I would rather work out what we can build, and find the
					people who want to build it.
				</p>
				<p class="subhead">
					<em>Everything here is a working draft. Pull up a chair.</em>
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="doors">
				<h2>Start with a question</h2>
				<div class="topicList">
					{
						topics.map((t) => (
							<a class="topic" href={`/topics/${t.slug}`}>
								<span class="topicLabel">{t.label}</span>
								<span class="topicDesc">{t.desc}</span>
							</a>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="stance">
				<h2>What I hold to</h2>
				<p>
					I believe new technology could make this a much better world, and I hold that belief
					as an obligation to be specific about how. When I write about dangers, and I will,
					every piece ends with a credible path forward. <em>Never doom without a door.</em>
				</p>
				<p>
					I explain things at the level you're actually asking, define jargon when it earns its
					place, and leave my thinking visibly unfinished where it is unfinished. You'll disagree
					with some of it. Good. Write me and say so.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="reach">
				<p>
					The best conversations here happen over email. Read something, then
					<a href="mailto:harry@harrymunroe.com">write me back</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			.hero {
				padding: 2em 0 1em;
			}
			.hero h1 {
				font-size: clamp(2.2em, 6vw, 3.2em);
				margin-bottom: 0.4em;
			}
			.subhead {
				max-width: 60ch;
				font-size: 1.05em;
				color: var(--ink-muted);
			}
			.doors,
			.stance {
				margin-top: 2.5em;
				padding-top: 1.5em;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
			}
			.topicList {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			.topic {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1em;
				align-items: baseline;
				padding: 0.7em 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
				color: var(--ink);
			}
			.topic:hover {
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.topic:hover .topicLabel {
				color: var(--accent-deep);
				text-decoration: underline;
				text-underline-offset: 3px;
			}
			.topicLabel {
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--accent);
				min-width: 6.5em;
			}
			.topicDesc {
				color: var(--ink-muted);
				font-size: 0.95em;
			}
			.stance p {
				max-width: 62ch;
			}
			.reach {
				margin-top: 2.5em;
				font-style: italic;
				color: var(--ink-muted);
			}
			@media (max-width: 600px) {
				.topic {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 0.15em;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
